  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Support for the Social Safety Net Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Apoyo Integral a la Red de Proteccin Social</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(i) consolidate the conditional cash transfer program of the Programa de Asignacin Familiar [Family Allowance Program] (PRAF) from a technical and operational standpoint, expand the scope of coverage, and coordinate the program with the social safety net; (ii) design and implement a gradual intervention scheme with an integrated approach to ensure the program&apos;s financial sustainability, and create synergies with intersector services; and (iii) encourage household participation in improving health services and education through supply-side support by means of community intervention strategies.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">(i) la consolidacin tcnico-operativa y ampliacin de cobertura del programa de transferencias condicionadas de PRAF, y su articulacin con la RPS; (ii) el diseo e implementacin de un esquema gradual de intervenciones que permita un enfoque integral, la sostenibilidad financiera del Programa, y genera sinergias con la oferta de servicios intersectoriales; y (iii) promover la participacin de los hogares en el mejoramiento de servicios de salud, educacin mediante un esquema de acompaamiento de la oferta a travs de estrategias de intervencin comunitaria.</narrative>
  </description>
